Hi,
I have a question regarding the use of MethylKit.

I have control and test

When I put the samples in this order I have
70% of hypomethylation and
30% hypomethylation.

file.list = list ("1 control", "2 control", "3 control", "1 test", "2 test ", "3 test")

metylbovine_control_test = read (file.list, sample.id <http://sample.id> = list ("1bcontrol", "2 control", "3 control", "1 test", "2 test ", "3 test "), assembly = "Btau_4.6.1 ", treatment = c (1,1,1,0,0,0), context =" CpG ")

*********************************

When I change the order of the samples in this way.

file.list = list ("1 test ", "2 test", " 3 test 3" 1 control "," 2 control "," 3 control ")

metylbovine__test_control = read (file.list, sample.id <http://sample.id> = list ("Test 1", "2 test", "test 3" 1control "," control 2 "," 3 control "), assembly =" Btau_4.6.1 "treatment = c (1,1,1,0,0,0), context = "CpG")

I have 70% of hypermethylation and
30% hypomethylation

what is the right way?

tnanks

